"\n"
"    Get sales KPIs for a specific period.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Parameters:**\n"
"    - period: 'today', '7_days', or '30_days' (default: 'today')\n"
"    "
