#: views/inventory.py:583
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get products that need reordering based on sales velocity, lead time,\n"
"    and safety stock calculations.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Urgency Levels:**\n"
"    - `immediate`: Less than 7 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `soon`: 7-14 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `upcoming`: 14-30 days of supply remaining\n"
"\n"
"    **Reorder Formula:**\n"
"    `suggested_qty = velocity * (lead_days + safety_multiplier * lead_days) - current_stock`\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Erhalte Produkte, die aufgrund der Verkaufsrate, der Lieferzeit\n"
"und Sicherheitsbestandsberechnungen neu bestellt werden müssen.\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 300 Anfragen pro Minute\n"
"\n"
"**Dringlichkeitsstufen:**\n"
"- `immediate`: Weniger als 7 Tage Lagerbestand verbleiben\n"
"- `soon`: 7–14 Tage Lagerbestand verbleiben\n"
"- `upcoming`: 14–30 Tage Lagerbestand verbleiben\n"
"\n"
"**Neubestellungsformel:**\n"
"`suggested_qty = velocity * (lead_days + safety_multiplier * lead_days) - current_stock`\n"
"    "

