msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get all notes for an order (both merchant and customer notes).\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Holt alle Notizen zu einer Bestellung (beide Händler- und Kundennotizen).\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 300 Anfragen pro Minute\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:337
msgid "Add note to order"
msgstr "Notiz zur Bestellung hinzufügen"

#: views/orders.py:338
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Add a note to an order. Can be used to reply to customer messages.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"\n"
"    **Fields:**\n"
"    - `note`: The note content (required)\n"
"    - `is_customer_visible`: Whether the customer can see this note (default: true)\n"
"    - `notify_customer`: Whether to send email notification to customer (default: false)\n"
"\n"
"    When replying to a customer's order note, set `is_customer_visible: true` so\n"
"    the customer can see your response in their order history.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Eine Notiz zu einer Bestellung hinzufügen. Kann verwendet werden, um auf Nachrichten des Kunden zu antworten.\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 30 Anfragen pro Minute (sensible Operation)\n"
"\n"
"**Felder:**\n"
"- `note`: Inhalt der Notiz (erforderlich)\n"
"- `is_customer_visible`: Ob der Kunde diese Notiz sehen kann (Standard: true)\n"
"- `notify_customer`: Ob eine E-Mail-Benachrichtigung an den Kunden gesendet werden soll (Standard: false)\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Sie auf eine Notiz des Kunden antworten, legen Sie `is_customer_visible: true` fest,\n"
"so dass der Kunde Ihre Antwort in seiner Bestellhistorie sehen kann.\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:388
msgid "Invalid note data."
msgstr "Ungültige Notizdaten."

#: views/orders.py:451
msgid "Note added successfully."
msgstr "Notiz erfolgreich hinzugefügt."

#: views/orders.py:460
msgid "Update order status"
msgstr "Bestellstatus aktualisieren"

#: views/orders.py:461
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Update the status of an order.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"\n"
"    **Allowed Transitions:**\n"
"    - pending → processing, cancelled\n"
"    - processing → shipped, cancelled, pending\n"
"    - shipped → delivered, processing\n"
"    - delivered → refunded\n"
"    - cancelled → pending (reopen)\n"
"    - refunded → (terminal state)\n"
"\n"
"    Optionally include tracking number when marking as shipped.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Aktualisieren Sie den Status einer Bestellung.\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 30 Anfragen pro Minute (sensible Operation)\n"
"\n"
"**Erlaubte Übergänge:**\n"
"- pending → processing, cancelled\n"
"- processing → shipped, cancelled, pending\n"
"- shipped → delivered, processing\n"
"- delivered → refunded\n"
"- cancelled → pending (wieder öffnen)\n"
"- refunded → (endgültiger Zustand)\n"
"\n"
"Bei der Kennzeichnung als versendet können Sie optional eine Tracking-Nummer einbeziehen.\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:554
msgid "Order status updated successfully."
msgstr "Bestellstatus erfolgreich aktualisiert."

#: views/orders.py:563
msgid "Update tracking number"
msgstr "Versandnummer aktualisieren"

#: views/orders.py:564
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Update or add tracking number for an order.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Aktualisiert oder fügt eine Tracking-Nummer für eine Bestellung hinzu.\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 30 Anfragen pro Minute (sensitiv)\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:607
msgid "Invalid tracking information."
msgstr "Ungültige Versandinformationen."

#: views/orders.py:636
msgid "Tracking information updated successfully."
msgstr "Versandinformationen erfolgreich aktualisiert."

#: views/orders.py:645
msgid "Cancel order"
msgstr "Bestellung stornieren"

#: views/orders.py:646
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Cancel an order. This is a destructive action.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"\n"
"    Only orders in pending or processing status can be cancelled.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Bestellung stornieren. Dies ist eine zerstörerische Aktion.\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 30 Anfragen pro Minute (empfindliche Operation)\n"
"\n"
"Nur Bestellungen im Status 'Ausstehend' oder 'In Bearbeitung' können storniert werden.\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:690
msgid "Only pending or processing orders can be cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Nur ausstehende oder verarbeitende Bestellungen können storniert werden."

#: views/orders.py:761
msgid "Order cancelled successfully."
msgstr "Bestellung erfolgreich storniert."

#: views/orders.py:770
msgid "Initiate refund"
msgstr "Rückerstattung starten"

#: views/orders.py:771
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Initiate a refund for an order.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 30 requests per minute (sensitive operation)\n"
"\n"
"    This endpoint initiates the refund process. Actual payment refund\n"
"    handling may depend on the payment provider configuration.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Rückerstattung für eine Bestellung initiieren.\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 30 Anfragen pro Minute (empfindliche Operation)\n"
"\n"
"Dieser Endpunkt startet den Rückerstattungsprozess. Die tatsächliche Rückerstattung\n"
"kann von der Konfiguration des Zahlungsdienstleisters abhängen.\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:816
msgid "Only paid orders can be refunded."
msgstr "Nur bezahlte Bestellungen können zurückerstattet werden."

#: views/orders.py:830
msgid "Invalid refund request."
msgstr "Ungültige Rückerstattungsanfrage."

#: views/orders.py:882
