"\n"
"    Get full details of a specific product including stock levels.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Rufen Sie vollständige Details zu einem bestimmten Produkt einschließlich Lagerbestände ab.\n"
"\n"
"**Rate Limit:** 300 Anfragen pro Minute\n"
"    "

#: views/products.py:333
